    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but what does that actually look like? like, not just \"choosing,\" but actually having a way to do it... so it's peaceful. if someone were to do it themselves to escape the chaos, how would they even make sure it was a dignified end instead of just something messy and terrifying?",
